    {
      "title": "Monica\u0027s Simple report to identify records with rogue character string ",
      "text": "-- to try and output just the records that relate to NRW_DS.  \n-- This is code Elena provided to identify records where some rougue access and use constraints (this is seperate query then identifying the ones with text in the wrong place. However in test generally the ones with this issue had other issues to andby fixing the other issues, this one got fixed).  See the MEDIN XML basecamp message\n-- select * from custom.metadata_xml where \"data\" like \u0027%gmd:otherConstraints xmlns:gn\u003d\"http://www.fao.org/geonetwork\" gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"%\u0027\n\n\n\nSELECT \n\tmx.id AS \"Database ID\", --selects the Geonetwork assigned identified\n\tmx.uuid AS \"NRW File identifier\", -- selects the NRW_DS number and returns into column NRW File Identified\n    array_to_string(xpath(\u0027/gmd:MD_Metadata/gmd:identificationInfo/gmd:MD_DataIdentification/gmd:citation/gmd:CI_Citation/gmd:title/gco:CharacterString/text()\u0027::text, mx.data_xml, \u0027{{gco,http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco},{gmd,http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd}}\u0027::text[]), \u0027-\u0027::text) AS \"Title\" -- extracts the Title of the individual record from the XML file in data Column\nFROM\n    custom.metadata_xml mx -- The data is held in the table called \"metadata\" in the syntax custom.metadata_xml mx\nWHERE (mx.istemplate \u003d \u0027n\u0027 OR mx.istemplate \u003d \u0027y\u0027) -- what does this do?  itemplate is one of the columns in the table called \"metadata\".  so this is proabablay ensureing that all records are included reguardless of whethere a \"template\"\n--AND mx.uuid LIKE \u0027NRW_DS%\u0027 -- selects only the records that begin with NRW_DS\nLIMIT 10; --limits the table output to 5 rows.  Take this off if want to run on all records",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-02-26 13:29:34.087",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "tableHide": true,
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "sql",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionSupport": true
        },
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/sql",
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "editorHide": true,
        "title": true,
        "results": {
          "0": {
            "graph": {
              "mode": "table",
