            "data": "NRW File identifier\tDate Created\tTitle\tGEMET Keywords\tNRW Keywords\tSeaDataNet/MEDIN Keywords\tIPSV Keywords\tSMNR Keywords\tValidation Status\tGroups Available in (GEMINI / MEDIN)\tRecord in Public view\nNRW_DS113460\t2024-05-28T12:35:30.071Z\t2008 CCW / ASML Carmarthen Bay Special Area of Conservation (SAC) Cockle Bed Survey\tSpecies distribution\tmonitoring (see specific types of monitoring eg. woodland monitoring), Carmarthen Bay and Estuaries SAC, Infauna, intertidal\tZoobenthos taxonomy-related counts, Sediment grain size parameters, Zoobenthos taxonomic abundance\t\t\tUnknown\tMEDIN\tPublic record\n"
