            "data": "NRW File identifier\tDate Created\tDate Last Edited\tLast Editor Name\tTitle\tMEDIN Keywords\tMEDIN Type\tGEMET Keywords\tGEMET Type\tNRW Keywords\tNRW Type\tIPSV Keywords\tIPSV Type\tSMNR Keywords\tSMNR Type\tValidation Status\tGroups Available in (GEMINI / MEDIN)\tRecord in Public view\nEXT_DS120645\t2024-05-28T12:14:10.803Z\t2026-02-26T15:12:40.000Z\tMonica Jones\tNetwork Rail: Level Crossings (3rd Party Data)\tNot Present\t-\t!! Missing (nilReason) !!\tAnchor\t3rd Party Data, Third Party Data\tCharacterString\tNot Present\t-\tNot Present\t-\tUnknown\t-\tPublic record\n"
